{"event": "text", "text": "The capital of France is **Paris**. One interesting fact about it is that the **Eiffel Tower was originally intended to be a temporary structure** built for the 1889 World's Fair, and it was supposed to be dismantled after 20 years—but it was saved because it proved useful as a radio antenna.<｜end▁of▁sentence｜>", "host_s": 94.4361}
